  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med projektet &#xE4;r att klarg&#xF6;ra institutionella, finansiella och tekniska f&#xF6;ruts&#xE4;ttningar f&#xF6;r att genomf&#xF6;ra en &quot;feasibility study&quot; i syfte att f&#xF6;rbereda att l&#xE5;nefinansierat investeringsprogram i Murmansk fj&#xE4;rrv&#xE4;rmen&#xE4;t.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at clarifying the conditions for making a feasibilitystudy serving as a basis for a possible future investment programme inthe district heating system of the city of Murmansk. The consultant&apos;s task is to collect, structure and analyse information regarding technical financial and institutional aspects relevant to the decison.</narrative>
